            濉叆涓婃父鍙樺帇鍣?姣嶇嚎鐨勯鏈熺煭璺數娴侊紝鑷姩鏍￠獙姣嶆帓鑰愬彈鑳藉姏
          </div>
        </el-form-item>

        <el-form-item label="鐩搁棿璺?(mm)">
          <el-input-number
            v-model="form.phaseSpacing"
            :min="50"
            :max="500"
            :step="10"
            class="!w-full"
          />
          <div class="text-[11px] text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 mt-1">
            姣嶆帓涓績璺濓紝鐢ㄤ簬璁＄畻鐭矾鐢靛姩鍔涘拰鏀拺闂磋窛
          </div>
        </el-form-item>
      </div>

      <!-- 鈻?骞舵満閰嶇疆 (v2.2 P2) -->
      <div class="space-y-3 mt-2">
        <div
          class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400"
        >
          <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-surface-200 dark:bg-surface-700"></div>
          <span>骞舵満閰嶇疆</span>
          <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-surface-200 dark:bg-surface-700"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-400">鍚敤骞舵満璁＄畻</span>
          <el-switch
            v-model="form.parallelEnabled"
            active-color="#06b6d4" class="dark:!opacity-90"
            inactive-color="#334155"
            size="small"
          />
        </div>

        <transition name="el-zoom-in-top">
          <div
            v-if="form.parallelEnabled"
            class="space-y-3 rounded-lg bg-purple-950/20 border border-purple-900/30 p-4"
          >
            <el-form-item label="骞舵満鎬诲彴鏁?(N+X)">
              <el-input-number
                v-model="form.parallelCount"
                :min="2"
                :max="8"
                :step="1"
                class="!w-full"
              />
            </el-form-item>
            <el-form-item label="鍐椾綑鍙版暟 (X)">
              <el-input-number
                v-model="form.parallelRedundant"
                :min="0"
                :max="form.parallelCount - 1"
                :step="1"
                class="!w-full"
              />
              <div class="text-[11px] text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 mt-1">
                {{ form.parallelCount - form.parallelRedundant }}+{{
                  form.parallelRedundant
                }}
                閰嶇疆锛?鎬诲閲?
                {{
                  form.kva * (form.parallelCount - form.parallelRedundant)
                }}
                kVA
              </div>
            </el-form-item>
          </div>
        </transition>
      </div>
    </el-form>

    <!-- 灞呬腑鑷畾涔夐鏍奸噸缃‘璁ゅ璇濇 -->
    <Teleport to="body">
      <transition name="el-fade-in">
        <div
          v-if="showResetDialog"
          class="fixed inset-0 z-[9999] flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm px-4"
        >
          <div
            class="glass-panel p-6 max-w-sm w-full border border-slate-700/50 shadow-2xl rounded-xl space-y-5"
            @click.stop
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div
                class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"
              >
                <el-icon class="text-xl text-amber-500"
                  ><ElIconWarningFilled
                /></el-icon>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200">纭閲嶇疆</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-400 leading-relaxed">
              鎮ㄥ綋鍓嶇殑鍘嬮檷閰嶇疆銆佽嚜瀹氫箟姣嶆帓鍙傛暟浠ュ強鍚勭浉闀跨煭绛夋暟鎹兘灏嗚褰诲簳娓呴櫎骞舵仮澶嶄负榛樿銆傛鎿嶄綔涓嶅彲鎭㈠銆?
            </p>
            <div class="flex gap-3 justify-end pt-2">
              <button
                class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium bg-surface-200 dark:bg-surface-700 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-white transition-colors flex-1"
                @click="showResetDialog = false"
              >
                鍙栨秷
              </button>
              <button
                class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 to-amber-500 hover:from-amber-500 hover:to-amber-400 text-white transition-all shadow-lg flex-1"
                @click="confirmReset"
              >
                纭閲嶇疆
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </transition>
    </Teleport>
  </div>
</template>

<script setup>
import { ref } from "vue";
import { ElMessage } from "element-plus";
import { useSmartBusbar } from "../composables/useSmartBusbar.js";
import { BATTERY_VOLTAGES, HARMONIC_LOAD_TYPES } from "../constants/index.js";

const { form, correctionK, windBonus, resetToDefault, harmonicInfo } =
  useSmartBusbar();

const showResetDialog = ref(false);

const batteryVoltages = BATTERY_VOLTAGES;

// 褰撹礋杞界被鍨嬪彉鍖栨椂锛岃嚜鍔ㄦ洿鏂癗绾跨郴鏁?
function onLoadTypeChange(val) {
  const entry = HARMONIC_LOAD_TYPES.find((h) => h.key === val);
  if (entry && entry.neutralFactor !== null) {
    form.neutralFactor = entry.neutralFactor;
  }
}

/**
 * 澶勭悊閲嶇疆鎿嶄綔
 */
function handleReset() {
  showResetDialog.value = true;
}

function confirmReset() {
  resetToDefault();
  showResetDialog.value = false;
  ElMessage.success("宸查噸缃负绯荤粺榛樿鍊?);
}
</script>



